{"id":"e095d63f890051fd","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure.md","title":"Arithmetic and Sigma-1 Diagonal Preimages","display":"cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure — Arithmetic and Sigma-1 Diagonal Preimages","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure","aliases":["92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure"],"display":"cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure — Arithmetic and Sigma-1 Diagonal Preimages","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 48、53，Theorem E Corollary 1、C1 Corollary 1（PDF 65、70）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure — Arithmetic and Sigma-1 Diagonal Preimages"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 48、53，Theorem E Corollary 1、C1 Corollary 1（PDF 65、70）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e68521c447f8d753\" href=\"?note=e68521c447f8d753\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code\">92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73270f29098db683\" href=\"?note=73270f29098db683\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation\">92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75a1feabdeb282fb\" href=\"?note=75a1feabdeb282fb\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1\">92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08d7841178f7293b\" href=\"?note=08d7841178f7293b\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse\">92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_E\">\\(d_E\\)</span> 为原书全域包裹对角码函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_E^*=\\{n:d_E(n)\\in A\\}\">\\(A_E^*=\\{n:d_E(n)\\in A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1\">\\(\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}\">\\(\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}\\)</span> 分别为无指数算术集类与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 集类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\{(n,m):d_E(n)=m\\}&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,2},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(A)&amp;\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(A_E^*),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}&amp;\\Rightarrow A_E^*\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\{(n,m):d_E(n)=m\\}&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,2},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(A)&amp;\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(A_E^*),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}&amp;\\Rightarrow A_E^*\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用指数关系得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"13^n\">\\(13^n\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 图，再与固定前缀和 13 进制 Cat 有界拼接图组合，给出 d 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 图；Sigma collapse 将它归成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 D 表达 d 的图、F 表达 A，则存在中间 m 使 D(n,m) 与 F(m) 同时成立的公式表达对角原像；先确定性改名以避免捕获。算术性在此有限公式组合下保持；若 A 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，使用正 Σ 组合和 collapse 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>。不能从“13 的幂集合可定义”跳过整个指数图关系的构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code","status":"resolved","id":"e68521c447f8d753","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"73270f29098db683","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse","status":"resolved","id":"08d7841178f7293b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d_E","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A_E^*=\\{n:d_E(n)\\in A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\{(n,m):d_E(n)=m\\}&\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,2},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(A)&\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(A_E^*),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}&\\Rightarrow A_E^*\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"13^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":1711,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"eed9e6920706b864","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["e68521c447f8d753","73270f29098db683","75a1feabdeb282fb","08d7841178f7293b"]}